<title>USA: Sunbelt Nursery Group Q3 shr loss $0.19.</title>
<headline>Sunbelt Nursery Group Q3 shr loss $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SUNBELT NURSERY GROUP INC</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share amount)</p>
<p>				   (unaudited)</p>
<p>			    Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>			 Mar 30,     Mar 31,    Mar 30,	Mar 31</p>
<p>			   1997	  1996	 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Sales		 $22,433     $27,333    $64,088     $79,613</p>
<p> Net loss	   ( 1,609)   ( 22,825)   ( 6,435)   ( 30,781)</p>
<p>Net loss</p>
<p>  per share	  ( 0.19)     ( 2.69)    ( 0.76)     ( 3.62)</p>
<p>Note: The company said the results for the three and nine month periods ending March 30, 1997 are due to the write off of goodwill and the impairment of other long-lived assets in the previous year that totaled $20.5 million.</p>
<p>The additional improvements are attributed to the its focus on inventory and margin control and the ongoing elimination of under-performing stores.</p>
